    "text": "By Zoe Strothers ,\n8 hours ago HARTFORD, Conn. (WFSB) - Hartford police are investigating after an apparent pipe bomb was found in a recently vacated apartment on Wyllys Street Wednesday afternoon. Officers responded to 127 Wyllys Street at around 1:06 p.m. on a report of an apparent pipe bomb found in the apartment. As a precaution,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
